Package: educrespmod
Title: Fit and Compare Educational Response Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Harvey", "Hingley", , "hh3g21@soton.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Toolkit for fitting and comparing statisical models of students responding to questions, including Item Response Theory (IRT) and Bayesian Knowledge Tracing (BKT) models. Provides data preprocessing tools, model fitting, prediction and evaluation. Uses real educational data as an example (ASSISTments).
